    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="With no injected current the model neuron rests at a stable fixed point. Between the two Hopf currents that fixed point is unstable, and the neuron fires repetitively on a relaxation limit cycle that runs along the outer branches of the cubic v-nullcline.">

