    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Trajectories starting both inside and outside the eventual limit cycle converge onto the same closed orbit -- the defining property that distinguishes a limit cycle from a linear center (whose orbit amplitude is set entirely by the initial condition).">

