.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Integrating \dot N = rN(1 - N/K) numerically reproduces Verhulst&#x27;s closed-form sigmoid exactly: growth looks exponential at first, is fastest at N = K/2, and saturates at the carrying capacity K from any positive starting population.">

