.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Every 2D linear system&#x27;s qualitative phase portrait near the origin is fixed by its Jacobian&#x27;s trace and determinant: node, saddle, spiral, or center. This script classifies six canonical matrices and plots their phase portraits side by side.">

