    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="A thousand oscillators with Lorentzian-distributed natural frequencies stay incoherent for weak coupling. Above the critical coupling K_c = 2\gamma a synchronized cluster forms, and the steady coherence follows Kuramoto&#x27;s exact result r = \sqrt{1 - K_c/K}.">

